sequenceDiagram
    participant Mail as Forge Mail
    participant MC as Mission Control
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant GPU as Forge GPU

    Mail->>MC: Send with idempotency key
    MC->>DB: Check owner and context, queue run
    DB-->>MC: Commit message and run
    MC-->>Mail: 202 with thread and run IDs

    Note over Mail,MC: Mail can close after 202
    Note over Mail,MC: An oversized draft stays unsent in the composer
    DB-->>GPU: Notify of new job
    GPU->>DB: Scan and claim with attempt lease
    DB-->>GPU: Exact completed pairs and new message
    GPU->>GPU: GPT-OSS 120B with optional prefix cache
    GPU->>DB: Renew lease during inference
    GPU->>DB: Publish reply with attempt token

    DB-->>MC: Notify of completed attempt
    MC->>DB: Commit reply and archive decision
    Note over MC,DB: Archive when context leaves too little room for a useful follow-up

    Mail->>MC: Open Inbox or Archive thread
    MC->>DB: Read owner’s message page
    DB-->>MC: Saved page and status
    MC-->>Mail: Archived thread opens read-only
